    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to someone but it feels pointless. what's the point in fixing a life that's already finished? the athlete i was... that's the only version of me that mattered. now i'm just stuck in this aftermath. it feels like the story is already over, i'm just waiting for the credits to roll.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
