      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your feelings of dignity and the desire to protect positive memories are very real and deserve to be heard. However, feeling like a burden is often a symptom of deep pain, not the truth of who you are. Please know that those who care for you want you here, and there is support available to help manage the pain without losing your sense of self. If you are in crisis, please reach out immediately to a crisis hotline for confidential support.",
